OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells, falling
OL,7,Fquite chilly in sheltered glens. High
OL,8,Fcloud will spread east from the late
OL,9,Fevening with rain and drizzle
OL,10,Ffollowing from shortly before morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA cloudy start with rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle soon clearing east. The rest
OL,14,Fof the day staying dry but cloudy in
OL,15,Fthe west, with some sunny periods in
OL,16,Fthe east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
